		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=43205#p43205"><![CDATA[
Ok.<br><br>The good news is: <strong class="text-strong">btDiscreteDynamicsWorld::internalSingleStepSimulation()</strong> is virtual.  You could derive <strong class="text-strong">MyDiscreteDynamicsWorld</strong> from <strong class="text-strong">btDiscreteDynamicsWorld</strong> and override that method to do what you want.  In other words: add <strong class="text-strong">doMySpecialStuff()</strong> between <strong class="text-strong">solveConstraints()</strong> and <strong class="text-strong">integrateTransforms()</strong>.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=11033">drleviathan</a> — Sat Nov 28, 2020 4:28 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
