One idea that occurs to me is: set the flag in the collision callback but harvest it in an Action within the same substep.  If you look inside <strong class="text-strong">btDiscreteDynamicsWorld::internalSingleStepSimulation()</strong> you will see: the collisions are computed and processed before the actions are updated.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=11033">drleviathan</a> — Fri Nov 27, 2020 2:27 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
